=== Format and prin1 edge cases ===
Integer %d: 42
Float %f: 3.141590
String %s: hello
S-exp %S: (a b c)
Octal %o: 377
Hex %x: ff
Hex %X: FF
Width 10: '        42'
Left-align: '42        '
Zero-pad: '0000000042'
Precision: '3.14'
Percent: %
Multiple: 1 two three
prin1 of string: "hello
world"
princ of string: hello
world
prin1-to-string: "(a \"b\" (c . d))"
Circular list: #1=(a b c . #1#)
Uninterned symbol: #:uninterned
